{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 615,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c380db68c40bc611477af91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "激光灯，好棒！真是太棒了！\\n我一定要站在那束直射的光芒\\n正中央，不，是一定会站上的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7afc560814561aeaf8b6c254b83c3513d67ad825835834cce14701c2108537a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "318"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdbf515bf66d564a4308ab64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "强大、华丽、柔韧。\\n——只有完全掌握一切的人，\\n才有资格在这首歌里成为主角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e70dab3a11c303de912e5dccde951339101ba7484daf683ff2920e9534a2d8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0db725efcb15434139eb950b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然奔跑的理由各有不同，\\n但我想大家内心所望都是一样的……\\n一言以蔽之就是「想要获胜」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9968549c2b62143a001161cf92d1157a5171b214c936dded35237e63b1c0fb8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc37d840074141c7fa32ed06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "LIVE舞台的弹出装置——\\n等候区的人超级紧张……\\n尤其是副歌部分更紧张……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e4cb46ba400552d506ddd91a43bca76f98c660c4ed0a4aa7da4ce3ce47e5852",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "320"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45c24950ce17272428d91451",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每次听这首歌就会想起……\\n刚知道学园里都是强者时，\\n那种由衷的兴奋感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13c02c4292afe725d56133b87ad78126794bc75796be57a69f9a3ca8bc78612d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6aa0fc1a9e9a6e26fab11a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『无数次不断奔跑』——\\n对许多赛马娘来说，\\n这就是希望之歌……我一直这么觉得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c3bcca11b9c9870e0c1c040ac2d6f0bb58ee29678aa3cb0df333915f9c5b77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edeb31d7aab65fdad6a494dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和西沙里奥竞争时的喜悦，\\n追逐皇冠时的憧憬——\\n这首歌，说的就是我吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5afc9b967fb03e62d57f7026c3e089fdcba47342170ef20cd7a6ff12ad056c1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "323"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab5ccb1d11d0ad91c64e174e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "上次去K歌看到勇心\\n边唱边跳，帅气极了！\\n我也想试试练习一下♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c1f10fc6957b357be5e62cbe35f76be7fde3b3ec19f79333884b43cd54067a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91fae49237a9b14c7de5417",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『怪鸟传说，开幕de-su！』\\n我一个人唱的时候，\\n会唱成神鹰特别版哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3410b679e4ef71e72a1241c50878b407286db62e2873cf54139d64487d5e4ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee8de01a3e1577bb4790e8e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说起来以前……\\n我们俩一起在剩下的煎饼罐里——\\n……没什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c22c355ae4b2a81d65aa7f64a35164bfa0e83342f55e328918fae32b18c950",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c98194f0892fc38e5fbdbb0f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一起磨练心灵的好对手【伙伴】！\\n……感觉很有英雄味，很棒呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "36362086b619533a1fba925882434f6305df9ac84994b1a76d066bb8dd1ffbad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "327"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f9152c979ac2d177927c7e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "玛雅很常听这首歌哦♪\\n不是都说『成熟女性不会回头看过去』嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "062eceb0d5cf97288e240104f187aca2d560259322a899e7d415b13ccead1e99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a032e0a7446958ac5214851a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是这首啊，涡轮经常\\n在唱。不得不说\\n歌词还挺让人有感触的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "95fc0022a2d4aa3a799bdb20649a71d608e799eb1704f59bf4b183e862c623bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8acb089d05be60dde6300c7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请选择喜欢的歌曲并慢慢欣赏～\\n需要为你泡杯茶吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "897204309decab891912c3bc5092846ea46c12747d57cc69efefe2a1abd000bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e44be9fe0226bc35b86ffe8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有能彼此照亮道路的伙伴……\\n真的很珍贵。\\n我也有类似的回忆呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f96d78065c03942488cf09b3ca12964da362578ae97b971f83474d7e2d76c38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46272fe03d86801ee03e3b61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱着唱着肚子就咕咕叫了，\\n然后小春丽说\\n『一样呢～！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb30d6bf0ba5c6535385497533c351f388060b74faab3aaeffcb911e5b45578",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0ba2c68da946bf9a46af6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在房间里唱歌时，善信\\n总会合着节拍喊『我要开动啦！』\\n气氛超棒的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "010199158fedc75e22e5a6e327fa5903623af3074394f7d39c0dbe6cf3a0ab9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "332"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d7b113a0755c56889dd7a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "青云同学『我都被小花的\\n哼唱洗脑了』，\\n……我唱了这么多次吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "313a14bb31c9bac375c71a26dc70a470b21c14fb519b09fc7f016244f0b5e611",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "333"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71375c88d34c98caf852ab6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "偶尔会边听音乐边做料理☆\\n这首歌感觉做菜也会特别美味，\\n所以我超喜欢的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d50f500ea816db0740aff7690fdd355520810ce641f8f8557f864325e79a1c11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "334"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42f0fc8fb25c8c1262dcb165",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想赢、想跑、想呐喊……\\n和那些家伙一起——！喂！\\n速子！茶座！快驹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e428f7aea3f864c349ad0bef3bf6b4cfa1bc1adcc84592494487f7236c69fbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "335"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:842507efea04c997245b5421",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『这就是本能』……正是如此，\\n我的求知欲也是一样——\\n所以，没办法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3b09971e750a8f4543a81be87d6dffe8b8bc35f378d372b6193f90d4b72dae7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "336"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddeafcaf7ecc9f57aacb6f0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "——嗯，是让人心跳加速的曲子呢。\\n——你也有同样的感觉吗……？\\n——呵呵，是吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "83f96403b11c9e37faab11072382159bfaffaf1ce560351cdbde2f2cdbb6b3fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "337"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a486f031096a731cb10d93da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能否用你精心挑选的\\n音乐，为我的修炼\\n增添一抹色彩？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86cc214976ae40da56e70fedd3055e1449ffe6283938a406bf45378706588512",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "338"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca87b3fc1064f2a0f5d848b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很擅长一个人合唱哦。\\n看，用ON和OFF唱！\\n哈哈，要不要随便唱一首？",
      "source_fingerprint": "079efe08bb0b7293d9e90b366037c3bcde23ad9eecaf58a58d991baad5a200fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "339"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ec3bdbb240af7b6bd03749",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在演唱会上也要持续燃烧斗志！\\n不论是最被看好还是大冷门，\\n都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "405f7dae39542055593cecc3ca1fb0bc4b0b3d85462ec8dd5a7cad376ac28bcb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de221ece7471f4a8c79f2fb8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说音乐能丰富心灵。\\n你现在需要的乐曲……\\n会是什么样的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19089a7a67c7410a5ddde82cabb8bfe1c5b036807225a6add6bb9a051b643b75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "340"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d05790a89e463625817a7b72",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦，好听的歌！\\n真想让青梅竹马们\\n也听一听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "883db1b6bb739c4b692e95e8e53659af583e6ebb203353917238222cb2ab605d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d783428572c9877b49cbd267",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可是啊可是啊……真是，\\n不肯放弃的歌词。\\n所以才会莫名一直在耳边回响吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "81ba4d0f2871ad7c20e5f59dc049a6a3b0d2670a55824dd38591dedf41617593",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bab3257279d7010dbefea0d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "追寻无形之物……\\n哈哈，总觉得完全不像是在说别人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "564b6aac946210422e80007c9b13f37f1b5945f3902c2e51a05159c5d17dc18b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "343"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d681baff224e297f8b6b9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一直循环是因为在工作。\\n后半段那种节奏感……很棒……\\n说完了。走开，别打扰我工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e1b352943acb59ea798ae46bbc7ba722e4ccd9d667993d1ae680168c54bbb9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "344"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c1da903e1df767b4b45d6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要在无尽黑暗中前行，\\n即使违背天命，也需要“火焰”。\\n照亮未来的“希望之灯”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37628fd41609b6438f147981da459cac205069c9d80c477f76b5014fbbda984",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44c4d738db0aaeaeb251b741",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "I’ll be alright——\\n——总有一天我也要——\\n自信地说出这句话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a319517ec21648ef7edbdb4f46827adfe3062a3f0cd3c4854cb79b67718110",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "346"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d15c56230b1da81394b278c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每首歌都能让我充满活力。\\n用来当打扫时的BGM，\\n也许会让工作更高效哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c7538ec11a1d27b72f326bb40a5301cbfb894057fd21c6832a5c2f44aea516",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "347"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0c71b597a611afd657c598",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我其实更喜欢\\n古典风格的歌。\\n听了就有点想跳舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a8aa9f8a9db988c56cbc822c62d0a40cb8f604c069fbc1c2b4aaf0e6ae39afb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "348"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc88b943373b4ee97d31eb3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "全都是让人感动的旋律。\\n我们一边喝梨汁，\\n一边一起静心聆听吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe22ee7ec882b98458dc78b065eb9c34c4f54259c8390c2723ff9511d2d2680",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "349"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404166cf2b258d8eddad78c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那家伙很强。\\n连自身的苦恼都克服了。真是的……\\n这样才值得我去打倒她嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b12dd95b2a5bb637fbc847ea4c9f32a4989444c66fab3acd5d78904c858b8a32",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dcde307c6afa6b530a743af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用音乐提升心情吧！\\n我要在你身边跳起来啦。……啊，\\n就算摔倒也会立刻爬起来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf96dc74d4fc955a1458d4378310ed94765aaee3a78001b4b789ad775be382dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "350"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e882f9c38dec7aeb191c1b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把我喜欢的乐曲拿来。\\n你不说也\\n应该明白吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cec2ed966ceb23754b86b8c7ea22d7922832ef1a6c02c5358f4fa04cb093420a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e20c7ea0dc42da7d7e11c76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "龙卷风~~~♪一起转起来～\\nFes上燥起来根本停不下来☆\\n太夏天啦～♪Put your hands up！",
      "source_fingerprint": "827c4cc336570ec67dbe8ed36462c1d986c35413d61e5b545263e094021c9e64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "352"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109819b3272d2c35a3816490",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每次听这首歌，沙子的触感、\\n贴在皮肤上的衬衫感觉……\\n都会让我想起最棒的夏天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5adcbce5be72eac19d1b111bf0ddd6f81e9cc112ad09bd589fe25bf8ff6a71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "353"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f09e8f2233f33c66c40e9fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论做什么，节奏都很重要……\\n这首歌恰好完美。\\n跟着节拍做仰卧起坐！很有用哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "282f16211272aa7fede67553e76695b9fbcc951aa8dcf2cfbf68cd34f420ef94",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "354"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:037f8f6a5b59d6908be8ca07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "音乐节这种事，没契机很难去吧？\\n那……要不要让我来\\n给你创造个机会？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e6f526cc46413fc7d591ee6dd18dc91ea0d92c6ba73cea81430821c6e6cb21c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "355"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae1b45d2a4cf612f59143342",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "画面上快速闪现出来的\\n是小真。大家一起找找看，\\n她出现在了哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d569647ce5013717c773758cb0d3f7646a4e29839de973da1747c8c31a0ca536",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "356"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a46cd818c8de8a4e0fe70b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的，团队赛太累人了！\\n你可得好好感谢我\\n参加了比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8295dcd6ee37570fdf94dde3b8bf0562d96e9b554016897aed763342f25906de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "357"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d1e4449824fbc055a3a02c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "承载着我们的灵魂……\\n跨越狂涛猛进吧！\\nSHAKEROCK！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93bba51bbd4747ff6b4eb947e2e010727cc6900d5aaac0e9aa22f4222165563d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "358"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be57751980b7a4fb50c0b13a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听着听着突然好想吃寿司！\\n出发吧，寿司！\\n玛雅要三文鱼蛋黄酱♪你呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef66672fe5d971222cd930ba4b0ec7e14562f42cb4083d6151a7524e0652775d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "359"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c769b9d12fe7a8335c20b33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练公！一起唱歌吧！\\n可不准你拒绝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c3d4cb59de5437f21e31e6aa0c96575b1d6075c8141c108cf509bd5da68189c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:665ebda0021e07d7a976d1cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每次放这首歌，背上的喵先生\\n都心情超好！招财猫果然也\\n喜欢鱼呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b9c2368d1d13913957a683f9a50d14aad0de2278f00ab067b819269f13a4f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "360"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93e0e9c2765dfe606fc7f151",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向着顶点进发～♪\\n“以巅峰为目标”……\\n真是太适合我的歌词了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60100e8c83648fff3996b1c2f032fcac8f0743aee376da2d986500e8f6026ec2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b876f804a2dbfef36f2aa2de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个……听说是音头我还以为\\n是慢节奏……一般人都会这么想吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce05037a76dab41ad927877bad0d10a626c377fe9d18e8773cfb21e3954a88dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d308c22a4b58afe295241cfd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "围着高台热烈旋转……\\n真是赌命的地方啊……\\n哼……我不讨厌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f6c5bd480662aa3b67efc505c14505e66c66a87d7ccd46901c202d958e75625",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "363"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f262fd4087383905bbe39e4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "‘T-DK’……\\n嗯嘛嘛嘛嘛\\nNMA NMA MA……『收到了』？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61007aab265b610bea42d1c3a5f4a6dc80852fbc5988825d3a0716fabcb86a0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "364"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77f0421082a5a820bdb310c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Bang!Bang!Burning♪\\n酷炫又火热的演出\\n点燃你的心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "269246dc29caf043ba3c249b2ac1f3ead2afd0b9f4d1f477c313bf229be7164f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "365"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:537383770e935666047e7fef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是这个！去卡拉 OK 的时候，\\n最后大家都会一起唱这首歌！\\n但是……总是会哭，所以从来没有唱完整过……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4f75432ef09241dd488b545e6224137fcae9d4a494947b1a396ad6d86976cbd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "366"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6190a71d8591007431de5c18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，原来是这首……\\n姐姐在听的歌。真是的，\\n笑得那么傻兮兮的……在干嘛啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0adb1054482da6aaa849b8d2919291183f089ccd29ed2f02996eb77f23000c89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "367"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2000df7779fdf408d3c1cce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虎视眈眈地反击大逆转……\\n局势越不利，\\n翻盘后的胜利才越大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5dbc049e4640433697559412e4475987f98a8169c57cb702c8e9b1ccda44c23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "368"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0a32a135e0eb2efd67a37b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这让我感到很受鼓舞呢。\\n作为一名以“梦的终点”为目标的旅人来说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8f23bf07618ba850ad8547badce5967bbfea104e3ab7d036a6772c5d0cf635",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "369"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3acecf8712d07d1e02e33771",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将绝不退让的意志\\n转化为奔跑的动力……\\n对我而言这就是这首歌的意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8365ab9d667b185632e6f6a083de96f49cca44cc23879140114f17e86cf94f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baef1ebd3134707c4d2b7407",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "潘多拉说要拿我的舞蹈动作\\n当范例！这可是……\\n责任重大，不能松懈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "542ad71a7c5620651759a0d9440ffd544038e8263992c469c15d90b8cb33e57d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "370"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e43697e8f38145d1ec7dc6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，不错。要不要也导入进\\n我的随身听……嗯？已经有了……\\n呵，是姐姐放的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3a6d2e5cdaef7b3f25bd78639d24ec8f9212bbf9f5a5e932701c551e89281de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbac656f23d9e7dd7fc4817f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和天狼星前辈、高峰前辈她们\\n一起唱歌时，以后能够一起创造传奇吧！\\n有这样的感觉～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d01ef77cc9d323071ec5edfe688cea05147dea324585598d28b401f3b4706a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac6bba0ee9531cc86d834d14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "历史会改变。\\n所以需要见证者，对吧。\\n所以——别把视线从我身上移开哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2ea8e87fd60bfc0b973e1e99ef597e8979b7272ccccbc5ae65bd5160be05b4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "373"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:574f74ab675225bd0e769841",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这种热情……好久没有了。\\n果然是被这首歌点燃了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dde70a79268ca3f806b701b74ed70890e7b81e9561c7e7ec068987926dc645e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "374"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:828a7e7150ac7ba8cf65db79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所谓传说……是讲述伟业，\\n流传后世，成为梦想。\\n所以，这首歌终将如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e80739b725bf5fbfee73f2d62d50e9bfc8176ac6c984160202544b208f4dd25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "375"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a100bd883b34dd263d241f62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有时要稳重，有时要大胆。\\n这才是传说——\\n运气与坚韧的积累。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eced0ec46b6e8162e2e2e64f7d0ac38d899d21c84079ee625f2f4e7d0ffa85b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "376"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa4486fee5e023ba9e6121ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让人心灵震撼的歌——\\n梦想的延续、未来的彼方。\\n画面浮现在眼前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec972922b15e17a43d4207730bb9e3a81f0c43c13c93eaf46d47443b3394b307",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "377"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b021bc0206d7b4f034d9f37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这份疾驰感和我的冲刺如出一辙。\\n一瞬的灵光，连剑芒都无法捕捉，\\n今后也会让你看到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdc58d090ab031af19abde9d5a6fc05f2ad5838640d0d45a54a133dbd6a5e7b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "378"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc6afa096f14427a162a130d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "歌词真的很有共鸣。\\n未来果然是要自己开拓的……\\n所以我要第一个冲向它！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28487a8325790b931e3747ef93eca8e11ad58ad83006e854a4c08fc4ee9ef991",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "379"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf7eea94e2b919637d6f793e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的是……！\\n拿黄金船一点办法都没有！\\n虽然很感激她照看我练习……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7e1f046fd43cef57ddf99691724eb3c1cd1716b931086190b4782c2c5a67fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836fc44165bb357242440bda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "戴上皇冠，\\n优雅地站在C位。\\n承载着母亲的心意与自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45e5fd95eb582a55571b779e305e3955a9de2ce16fbda97461df3dac72a5141f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "380"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d44711f8b3c1503ddf0ce290",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耀眼的黄金遮住了视线……\\n等看到彼岸的景色时。\\n我要尽情高歌这首歌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b99a5b1a4920262e01dc4fc7cfaccc887a68a5bd0f97869a37436af3fae528b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff0819875b08cd6aef447830",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使在中央舞台，\\n我也会高歌一曲。\\n突破强敌与极限，站在最中央！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0276b6eca7e3252b3e4a17dede9971074085e12425d9e342bc425b3d91cb066",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "382"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d01c9c78bf466764d2e4572",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只会憧憬的日子结束了。\\n今后可以全力奔跑在赛道上！\\n轮到我唱歌了——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60cb8f3852feffdd233b1b00180d56f8367ae9d954effd3674b392d126fd43ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "383"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6557b6444f409048d4f91172",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是属于我的凯歌。\\n端坐聆听吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "790d4c13ccf9818edcc4df6b181a246ba0cd6760c9d0001eed5a4752ef5c62f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "384"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24f383f4f09135b3d9d0dd7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我喜欢音乐哦！不论抒情还是\\n快节奏，我的准则就是\\n一边跳舞一边听！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c57c7423525ee446f14b01d3d5319ba1ca83b45ca54c3701b3848a41436bd16",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "385"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05db709185963c562b2deb77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哟，还真收集了不少乐曲！\\n来，把我的扇子借给你，\\n陪我一起跳舞吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e67f5fb559ca6b0477c0b6b9b1e263d29b801ec76a10363832b17c37371da27c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "386"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e87b9d0ada3b428da23ea5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好像各种类型的歌都有呢！\\n……会不会也有交通安全\\n宣传歌之类的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05708b097463708e57f61238aa616a2a31f216fbf6dd7cd044d1843edb23559d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "387"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7fc1c118a3b83e825d1e9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来打个赌吧。这首歌能不能\\n让观众陶醉。如果我输了……\\n这顶帽子就是你的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2980c3e1be08c46c8feba0168c413699cb04957a16be02693721d133aacbe27a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "388"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd9654164ba84524c9764c24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在房间里听这首歌时，荒漠印象说\\n好像想要针织帽……\\n下次要一起去买同款。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1128baaa9caea62584ca8d2ca7f31bc49141e739c645275024d8afe50e2a62f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "389"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09c370071d034ec42c880f80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不管哪一首都是毫不逊色的名曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "753e70c7d8aa761c482f07da40feeba00ea7080c53b7712aa500331bcb13f559",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "39"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
